# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Opel_Corsa
# Vauxhall Corsa E: orders opened October 2014, first UK deliveries January
# 2015; production 2014-2019. UK registrations 94,211 (2015), 79,955 (2016).
#
# Colours: Summit White, Mineral Black, Asteroid Grey, Darkmoon Blue. These are
# the four largest DVSA shares for 2015-2019 registrations: white 18-22%, black
# 19-20%, grey 16-23%, blue 15-17%. Red (10-13%) is the next colour and is not
# modelled. Paint names are Vauxhall marketing names for the approximate shades;
# the render values are approximations, not paint codes.
#
# Dates are staggered per colour. Weights total 48 against the Focus's 99.

